          "Reactions are part of the genre: \"Che ridere!\", \"Questa è bella!\", \"Non l'ho capita\" (I didn't get it), \"Che battuta!\". If you don't get a joke, \"Me la spieghi?\" is perfectly acceptable, and Italians love explaining jokes almost as much as telling them.",
